  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "The solubility of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CdSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> in water is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. Its solubility in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;solution is ___&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;(Round off to the Nearest integer) (Assume that&nbsp;solubility is much less than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math> )",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "64",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In pure water,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>In <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></munder><mo>&#8594;</mo><munder><mrow><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo></msubsup></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><mrow><msubsup><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></munder></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>&#8773;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math></p>",
